{
  "$description": "State vocabulary -> presentation (CONVENTIONS S1). Every domain is keyed by exactly one enum of the observer contract (contracts/empirica-ui-view/v1), held equal by tests/contract.test.mjs. Each entry: tone (semantic colour), icon (meaning key in icons.json), copy key prefix in copy/en.json (label + hint). `quiet: true` marks the usual or bookkeeping values: an overview mark carries no glyph for them and a history folds them, so everything else stands out (V3). A claim is quiet only when its state and its review both are: an approved claim no passing audit has reviewed carries its review's glyph. `minor: true` (steps) draws a small dot. A step takes its outcome's tone when it has one.",
